---
layout: default
---
{%- comment -%}
  Pagina di un singolo lavoro (cartella _works/) o di un singolo post (cartella _blog/).
  Struttura: titolo e sottotitolo, autore + data + icona verso il testo originale, testo, tag, commenti.
  Campi del file .md (front matter):
    title    titolo                              date     AAAA-MM-GG (nei Works si vede solo l'anno)
    summary  sottotitolo (anche per Google)      tags     etichette, come nell'elenco
    where    (solo Works) Paper, Seminar, ...    source   link al testo originale (Substack, PhilPapers, ...)
  L'icona verso l'originale non ha scritte: nome del sito (Substack, PhilPapers...) solo come
  suggerimento al passaggio del mouse e per i lettori di schermo, ricavato dal link: se cambi il link, cambia da solo.
  A destra c'e' anche il pulsante con la stampante (stampa la pagina / salva come PDF).
  Il testo, in Markdown, va sotto il secondo "---". Se e' vuoto la pagina mostra solo il link all'originale.
  Commenti: compaiono quando in _config.yml giscus.repo_id e giscus.category_id sono compilati.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if page.collection == 'works' -%}
  {%- assign sec_name = 'Works' -%}
  {%- assign sec_url = '/works/' -%}
  {%- assign sec_tags = site.data.work_tags -%}
  {%- assign sec_kind = 'work' -%}
  {%- assign date_fmt = '%Y' -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign sec_name = 'Blog' -%}
  {%- assign sec_url = '/blog/' -%}
  {%- assign sec_tags = site.data.tags -%}
  {%- assign sec_kind = 'post' -%}
  {%- assign date_fmt = '%-d %B %Y' -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- capture author_name -%}{{ site.first_name }} {{ site.last_name }}{%- endcapture -%}

{%- comment -%} nome del sito da cui viene il testo originale {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign src_label = nil -%}
{%- if page.source -%}
  {%- if page.source contains 'substack.com' -%}{%- assign src_label = 'Substack' -%}
  {%- elsif page.source contains 'philpapers.org' -%}{%- assign src_label = 'PhilPapers' -%}
  {%- elsif page.source contains 'github.com' -%}{%- assign src_label = 'GitHub' -%}
  {%- elsif page.source contains 'youtube.com' or page.source contains 'youtu.be' -%}{%- assign src_label = 'YouTube' -%}
  {%- elsif page.source contains 'zenodo.org' -%}{%- assign src_label = 'Zenodo' -%}
  {%- elsif page.source contains 'arxiv.org' -%}{%- assign src_label = 'arXiv' -%}
  {%- else -%}{%- assign src_label = 'Original' -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if src_label == 'Original' -%}{%- assign src_hint = 'Read the original' -%}{%- else -%}{%- capture src_hint -%}Read the original on {{ src_label }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- assign body = content | strip -%}
{%- assign words = content | number_of_words -%}
{%- assign minutes = words | divided_by: 200.0 | ceil -%}

<article class="entry">
  <p class="entry-back"><a href="{{ sec_url | relative_url }}">&larr; {{ sec_name }}</a></p>

  <header class="entry-head">
    <h1 class="entry-title">{{ page.title }}</h1>
    {%- if page.summary %}
      <p class="entry-sub">{{ page.summary }}</p>
    {%- endif %}

    <div class="entry-meta">
      <div class="entry-by">
        <img class="entry-avatar" src="{{ '/assets/img/favicon.png' | relative_url }}" alt="" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        <div class="entry-by-txt">
          <span class="entry-author">{{ author_name }}</span>
          <span class="entry-date">
            <time datetime="{{ page.date | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}">{{ page.date | date: date_fmt }}</time>
            {%- if page.where %} &middot; {{ page.where }}{% endif -%}
            {%- if words >= 150 %} &middot; {{ minutes }} min read{% endif -%}
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="entry-actions">
        {%- if page.source %}
          <a class="entry-btn entry-source" href="{{ page.source }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="{{ src_hint }} (opens in a new tab)" title="{{ src_hint }}">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M14 4h6v6"/><path d="M20 4 11 13"/><path d="M18 14v4.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 16.5 20h-11A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4 18.5v-11A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5.5 6H10"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        {%- endif %}
        <button class="entry-btn entry-print" type="button" onclick="window.print()" aria-label="Print this page or save it as PDF" title="Print this page or save it as PDF">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M7 8V3.5h10V8"/><path d="M7 17H5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4 15.5v-6A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5.5 8h13A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 20 9.5v6a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5H17"/><rect x="7" y="14" width="10" height="6.5" rx="1"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  {%- if body != '' %}
    <div class="entry-body">
      {{ content }}
    </div>
  {%- elsif page.source %}
    <p class="entry-stub">The full text of this {{ sec_kind }} is not on this page yet. <a href="{{ page.source }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% if src_label == 'Original' %}Read the original{% else %}Read it on {{ src_label }}{% endif %}</a>.</p>
  {%- endif %}

  {%- if page.tags and page.tags.size > 0 %}
    <div class="entry-tags feed-tags" aria-label="Tags">
      {%- for tid in page.tags -%}
        {%- assign t = sec_tags | where: 'id', tid | first %}
        <a class="tag-chip" href="{{ sec_url | relative_url }}?tags={{ tid }}">{{ t.label | default: tid }}</a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  {%- endif %}

  {%- if page.collection == 'blog' and page.source contains '/p/' %}
    {%- assign sub_url = page.source | split: '/p/' | first %}
    <p class="entry-subscribe">Enjoyed this? <a href="{{ sub_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Subscribe on Substack &rarr;</a></p>
  {%- endif %}

  {%- if site.giscus.repo and site.giscus.repo_id and site.giscus.category_id %}
    <section class="entry-comments" id="comments" aria-labelledby="entry-comments-h">
      <h2 id="entry-comments-h">Comments</h2>
      <p class="entry-comments-note">Comments are handled by GitHub: to write one you need a free GitHub account.</p>
      {% include giscus.liquid %}
    </section>
  {%- endif %}
</article>

{%- comment -%}
  Dati strutturati per Google (invisibili): descrivono questo lavoro/post e il percorso Home > sezione > pagina.
  Tipo: Blog -> BlogPosting; Works -> dal campo `where` (Paper = ScholarlyArticle, "... thesis" = Thesis, altro = CreativeWork).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if page.collection == 'blog' -%}
  {%- assign jl_type = 'BlogPosting' -%}
{%- elsif page.where == 'Paper' -%}
  {%- assign jl_type = 'ScholarlyArticle' -%}
{%- elsif page.where contains 'thesis' -%}
  {%- assign jl_type = 'Thesis' -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign jl_type = 'CreativeWork' -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if page.collection == 'works' -%}{%- assign jl_fmt = '%Y' -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign jl_fmt = '%Y-%m-%d' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if page.tags contains 'italian' -%}{%- assign jl_lang = 'it' -%}{%- elsif page.tags contains 'english' -%}{%- assign jl_lang = 'en' -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign jl_lang = site.lang -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign jl_url = page.url | absolute_url -%}
{%- assign jl_img = site.og_image | default: '/assets/img/og-image.png' | absolute_url -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": {{ jl_type | jsonify }},
      "@id": {{ jl_url | append: '#work' | jsonify }},
      "name": {{ page.title | jsonify }},
      "headline": {{ page.title | jsonify }},
      "url": {{ jl_url | jsonify }},
      "mainEntityOfPage": {{ jl_url | jsonify }},
      "datePublished": {{ page.date | date: jl_fmt | jsonify }},
      "inLanguage": {{ jl_lang | jsonify }},
      "image": {{ jl_img | jsonify }},
      {%- if page.summary -%}
      "description": {{ page.summary | jsonify }},
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if page.where -%}
      "genre": {{ page.where | jsonify }},
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if page.source -%}
      "sameAs": {{ page.source | jsonify }},
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if page.tags and page.tags.size > 0 -%}
      "keywords": [
        {%- for tid in page.tags -%}
          {%- assign jl_t = sec_tags | where: 'id', tid | first -%}
          {{ jl_t.label | default: tid | jsonify }}{% unless forloop.last %}, {% endunless %}
        {%- endfor -%}
      ],
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if words >= 150 -%}
      "wordCount": {{ words }},
      {%- endif -%}
      "isPartOf": { "@type": "CollectionPage", "name": {{ sec_name | jsonify }}, "url": {{ sec_url | absolute_url | jsonify }} },
      "author": { "@type": "Person", "@id": {{ '/' | absolute_url | append: '#person' | jsonify }}, "name": {{ author_name | jsonify }}, "url": {{ site.url | jsonify }} }
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": {{ '/' | absolute_url | jsonify }} },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": {{ sec_name | jsonify }}, "item": {{ sec_url | absolute_url | jsonify }} },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": {{ page.title | jsonify }}, "item": {{ jl_url | jsonify }} }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</script>
